libopenwch-examples — provenance and licensing
==============================================

What this repository is
-----------------------

A collection of example firmware programs for libopenwch, plus the small
`rules/` layer that lets each example be built with a plain `make`.  It exists
to demonstrate the library and to serve as libopenwch's integration test.

It is **not** a project template.  If you want a starting point for your own
firmware, use libopenwch-template instead; this repository is what you read to
see how a feature is driven.

It contains no library code: the drivers come from the libopenwch submodule at
`libopenwch/`, which is a checkout of the library's own repository and carries
its own licence.  Nothing in the submodule is modified here.

