Derived from libopencm3 and libopenwch
--------------------------------------

`rules/rules.mk` and `rules/toolchain.mk` are derived from libopencm3's
application makefiles (LGPL-3.0-or-later), and follow libopenwch's adaptations
of them for RISC-V and generic `riscv64-unknown-elf` toolchains.

  libopencm3        https://github.com/libopencm3/libopencm3     LGPL-3.0+
  libopenwch        https://github.com/LrkSeraph/libopenwch      LGPL-3.0+
  libopencm3-template
                    https://github.com/bonedaddy/libopencm3-template
                    the model for the PROJECT/DEVICE/OPENWCH_DIR layout

The examples are original to this project.  The CH58x BLE example links WCH's
closed-source Bluetooth stack, which is **not** part of this repository and is
Apache-2.0; see libopenwch's NOTICE and `lib/ble/README` for that boundary.

